=== STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces) ===
  loading ......... initial-fetch skeleton (4 tile-shaped skeletons in the data grid)
  data ............ the four-tile grid (web `securityData ? grid`); a present reading always
                    renders the grid (unit tested)
  empty ........... no reading (web `!securityData`) → ContentUnavailableView, never blank
  error ........... parent-query failure → retry affordance (web QueryError peer) →
                    model.refresh()
  stale ........... freshness window exceeded → amber freshness chip + banner + one guarded
                    auto-refresh on the stale transition (web refetch self-refresh)
  offline ......... no connectivity → cached values + offline chip + banner
  Each has a #if DEBUG preview (8 previews: loading / data·secured / data·alert /
  data·partial / empty / error / stale / offline) and is exercised by the per-state
  ImageRenderer render test (EXECUTED green).

